# ~/.config/mole/whitelist — paths `mo clean` must never touch.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE EDITING (upstream replacement semantics, mole V1.7.5+):
# the mere EXISTENCE of this file makes mole drop its entire built-in
# DEFAULT_WHITELIST_PATTERNS list (lib/core/base.sh) — the file is treated as
# the complete set, not as an addition. Only SAFETY_WHITELIST_PATTERNS
# (Spotlight / FontRegistry / CloudKit / pypoetry virtualenvs / FINDER_METADATA)
# still merge unconditionally, so those are deliberately not repeated here.
# That is why the first block below re-lists upstream's own defaults verbatim:
# delete a line from it and you silently lose that protection. Upstream
# documents the trap itself at lib/core/base.sh:188-192.
#
# Format: one absolute path or glob per line; `#` comments; `~` and $HOME are
# expanded; no `..`, no `//`; entries must be absolute after expansion.
# `mo clean --whitelist` rewrites this file interactively, which is why chezmoi
# seeds it with `create_` and then never touches it again. To re-baseline:
#   cp ~/.config/mole/whitelist "$(chezmoi source-path ~/.config/mole/whitelist)"
# See docs/tools/mole.md.

# --- upstream DEFAULT_WHITELIST_PATTERNS, re-listed (see header) -------------
$HOME/Library/Caches/ms-playwright*
$HOME/.gradle/caches/*
$HOME/.gradle/daemon/*
$HOME/.ollama/models/*
$HOME/Library/Caches/com.nssurge.surge-mac/*
$HOME/Library/Application Support/com.nssurge.surge-mac/*
$HOME/Library/Caches/org.R-project.R/R/renv/*
$HOME/Library/Caches/JetBrains*
$HOME/Library/Caches/com.jetbrains.toolbox*
$HOME/Library/Caches/tealdeer/tldr-pages
$HOME/Library/Application Support/JetBrains*
$HOME/Library/Caches/com.apple.finder
$HOME/Library/Mobile Documents*

# --- this repo's own bootstrap surfaces -------------------------------------
# uv is the bootstrap for every PEP723 script here (fleet, tsnet, mlf, yth,
# ytmv, pqsum, dotfiles_init) and for `just` recipes that shell out to them.
# mole targets ~/.cache/uv in lib/clean/dev.sh; a cold cache turns the next
# `chezmoi apply` into a full re-download.
$HOME/.cache/uv/*
# bun runs dot_config/shell/copilot-throttle-shim.js on every copilot-proxy call.
$HOME/.bun/install/cache/*
# mise owns real runtime installs under here, not just cached downloads
# (mole targets .local/share/mise/installs/pnpm specifically).
$HOME/.local/share/mise/*
